WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.640
<i>Our goal lies right before us.</i>

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.300
<i>Kill the Insect Magistrate!</i>

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.280
The Insect Magistrate is 
staying at Hachijo Island.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:39.400
And a group, the Insect Hunters, is after her.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.370
Is that true, Kotori-dono?

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.580
If they're sending us, 
the city patrol,

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.590
with the Samurai House Patrol

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:56.420
and Shrine and Temple Patrol,

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.520
who will protect Edo?

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.590
Listen to me, Jinbei-kun...

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.230
If anything were to happen 
to the Insect Magistrate,

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.100
Edo would be flattened within a single night.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:09.460
I-It would?

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:17.610
<b>The Insect Hunters Attack!! 
Battle of Hachijo Island!!</b>

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:21.370
<b>Port of Edo</b>

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.370
What?

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.210
This ship is huge!

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.380
It's the Insect Magistrate's personal ship.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.630
Cast off at once!

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.390
A huge insect, now of all times?

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:47.140
That's near Oharu-dono's house...

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.020
There isn't time. 
Launch immediately.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.700
Hey, what about the insect?

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:03.030
Right now, our job is to 
protect the Magistrate.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:08.090
I'm sorry, but they'll have 
to suffer for a while.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:09.710
Then I will...

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:15.380
I'm sure it's difficult, but we have 
another task at the moment.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.700
Kotori-dono!

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.340
O-Oharu-dono...

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:29.430
We, the Samurai House Patrol,

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.300
will handle this task.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.360
Ogami-dono!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:40.420
We cannot leave an insect alone

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.700
at the base of the Shogun's palace.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.200
Ogami Kagetada and his patrol group

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:51.460
will gladly attend to this task, 
as servants of the shogunate!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.340
Ogami-dono, please save Edo!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.280
Let us go, then...

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.560
We head for Hachijo Island!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.350
<b>Hachijo Island</b>

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:16.860
Our goal lies before us.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.070
Kill the Insect Magistrate!

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.660
The island's coming into view!

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.890
What? That's Hachijo Island?

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.990
The Insect Magistrate is there, right?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.650
I want to die...

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.530
Manako.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.610
Then it was you?

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.660
So the traitor leads the way?

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.660
<b>Manako</b>

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:51.620
What?

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:55.220
No way...

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.290
He's evenly matched with Mugai-san?

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:02.540
He's as good as Mugai-dono?

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.960
Exactly who are you?

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.600
What's this, Mugai?

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.970
You still haven't told them anything?

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:19.190
I'm Manako... Of the Insect Hunters.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.890
Insect Hunters?

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.570
Tired...

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:29.200
Perhaps my friends have killed 
the Insect Magistrate by now.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:30.840
What?

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:33.200
Your goal is to kill the Insect Magistrate?

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.450
Out of the way, Mugai!

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:47.300
Insect Hunters...

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:58.290
<i>A group known as the Insect Hunters
 killed your mother.</i>

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:03.290
Was it you who killed the wife 
of Koikawa Sanosuke,

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.020
Okiku, ten years ago?

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.990
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.300
Hurry, everyone!

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:23.860
I can't let you go.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:37.970
Bastard!

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:40.680
We're fine!

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.040
So are we.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:47.150
Hibachi-kun and Jinbei-kun, go on ahead.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.820
We'll catch up!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:49.950
Got it.

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:51.750
Leave it to us!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.040
I won't let anyone else escape.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:11.010
You see... I want to die.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:17.480
Living in this insane world is torture for me.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.740
So I want

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:24.510
to kill the Insect Magistrate as soon 
as possible and find peace.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.230
For that, I volunteered to take out the trash.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:37.240
It won't be long before I can 
bid this world farewell!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:44.420
Will you kill me?

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.720
Answer me!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.070
Did you kill Okiku?

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.610
You missed... Too bad.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.600
No, I didn't.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.750
How do you like the cannons?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.460
Not enough to kill me...

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:52.270
I won't change my title of Killer of 99, 
for killing a loser like you.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.280
There he is!

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:03.990
Koikawa-kun!

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.000
Let's hurry, Kotori-chan.

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:27.480
It appears we have intruders on this island.

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:39.550
I'm sorry to all the creatures 
that live on Hachijo Island.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:43.620
Wait.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.220
What is it, leader?

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.880
Are you scared?

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:50.620
The insects stopped chirping.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.130
The insects?

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:02.550
Poison fog.

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:04.300
Seriously?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:06.980
Everyone, drink your antidotes.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.000
Let's go.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.450
The Insect Magistrate is within
 this poison fog.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:19.610
Hey!

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.400
Tsukishima, what are you grabbing?

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.000
Let go of me.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:24.980
I can't...

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.670
I'll die!

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.060
What?

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:30.580
What is that fog?

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.570
I don't know.

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.960
Stay sharp.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.590
We're the first ones here.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.790
Hibachi-dono, leave it to me!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:42.870
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, shall do everything

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.350
in my power to not slow you down!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.330
Where are your hands?

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:57.440
Those are the Insect Hunters?

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:02.940
Tsukishima?

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.380
O-Ow...

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.470
Y-You're...

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:35.400
You're the girl I met
 at the Insect Magistrate's!

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.810
I understand.

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:47.570
If you're here, you must be a 
servant of the Magistrate.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.330
No, I'm...

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:55.630
Miss, I'm sorry, but I have an 
urgent matter to discuss...

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:57.480
Where is the Magistrate?

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.670
I am...

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.200
I see...

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.670
The Magistrate is not here, then?

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.590
No, I am...

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.200
Right.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:11.530
So you're heading out to find 
the Magistrate now, aren't you?

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:17.540
I am...

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.070
Yes.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.360
Actually, you're right.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.440
I knew it!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.280
Let's hurry, then.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.430
A group called the Insect Hunters
 is almost here.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.370
They're after the Magistrate's life.

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:35.320
There is no need to worry.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:39.880
No one could make it here 
through that poisonous fog.

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:42.290
I suppose so...

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:44.170
But the Magistrate...

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:48.680
She's...

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.600
She's in a safe place.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.490
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms.</i>

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:16.910
I won't stand here and let you attack me.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.910
<b>Mashiro</b>

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:20.330
She blocked the explosions with 
the shock wave from her kicks?

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.950
This is the Insect Hunters' power,

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.340
stupid, weird-faced girl.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.220
W-Weird-faced?

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.220
You're a flat-chested four-eyes!

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.930
You shouldn't have said that.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.240
<i>Armor Kick!</i>

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:48.370
So the Insect Magistrate 
spends the summers here,

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:51.270
in this place devoid of life...

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:58.540
Um, miss, what is the
 Insect Magistrate like?

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:02.550
Well, I suppose I could tell you a bit.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.130
The Magistrate is...

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:08.230
I picture someone big and strong,

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:12.000
and quite disciplined,
 like a Buddhist priest.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.890
Yes, you're right.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:17.790
I knew it!

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.290
I guess it doesn't matter.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.620
Without that kind of strength,

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:25.440
the Magistrate would never last 
in a lonely place like this!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.960
It's possible the Magistrate 
doesn't find it lonely at all.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:41.060
That she'd like to stay here all the time.

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.590
The Magistrate has no freedom.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.670
In Edo, it is difficult for her to 
even go outside the bamboo shades.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:54.680
But here, at least she can 
always look up at the sky.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:03.350
To be honest, I don't
 really understand all that.

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:06.190
But I can say this for sure...

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.460
Looking at the sky here

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:13.990
won't make you nearly as happy as it would 
if you were with everyone in Edo!

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:23.350
<i>When he looks at the sky, 
he probably always feels that way.</i>

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:29.510
<i>And that makes me envy him a little.</i>

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:35.330
If the Magistrate had someone 
like you by her side,

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:38.010
perhaps she might find it enjoyable.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.380
At last we meet, Insect Magistrate.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:54.990
Now, goodbye!

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:12.460
Acidic poison?

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.060
You bastard!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:18.300
He disappeared?

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.360
The fog is disappearing!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:49.500
I won't let you pass.

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:50.170
<b>Kuroganemaru</b>

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.800
<i>Whoever killed her was good.</i>

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:01.510
<i>A group known as the Insect Hunters
 killed your mother.</i>

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.220
<i>The Insect Hunters?</i>

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:07.920
<i>You noticed it, didn't you?</i>

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:12.290
<i>Only someone very skilled 
could have cut like that.</i>

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:21.070
This wimp can only fire a gun.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:24.030
He didn't kill my mom, then.

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:27.190
Hey, Tenma! You take this wimp!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:29.800
Die...

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.240
<i>Do my bidding!</i>

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:35.050
<i>Tamekichi, Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.350
<i>Matsukichi, do my bidding!</i>

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.720
I won't fall for that again!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.680
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.180
Come... Let us end this.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:01.450
Wait, Insect Hunters!

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:05.950
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, 
shall be your opponent.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:09.980
Miss, are you safe?

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:11.710
Leave them to me...

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.550
You get to the Magistrate!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.110
<i>What horrible timing...</i>

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:21.870
<i>I moved the fight away to avoid 
getting you caught up in it.</i>

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.300
Die!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:25.930
<i>Here they come.</i>

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.060
Let's go, Insect Hunters!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:31.310
What?

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:37.240
Stop!

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.740
<i>Not again.</i>

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.710
<i>I must get away now!</i>

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:55.030
I don't understand.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.170
<i>What is this?</i>

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.970
<i>This isn't like normal.</i>

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:04.300
<i>The Insect Hunters are here to kill me,</i>

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.250
<i>but I can only think of something else.</i>

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.180
<i>Why?</i>

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.860
Miss, are you hurt?

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:13.690
<i>That's it...</i>

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:20.230
<i>Right now, the only thing I can 
think of is this Tsukishima.</i>

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:35.330
Hello again, Mugai.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:39.210
I never thought the day would 
come when I'd fight you...

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.220
<b>Gaikotsu</b>

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.430
<i>Secret Blade: Blood Splatter!</i>

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.390
I guess you're still as good as when

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.900
you were leader of the Insect Hunters.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.600
Mugai...

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:19.170
What does he mean you were 
leader of the Insect Hunters?

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.170
Did you

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:26.680
kill my mother?!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:03.270
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:05.090
White flowers, white sand, 
white waves, white clouds.

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:07.490
No, Hibachi-dono is flying over there.

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:09.200
Her underwear is white!

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:10.200
Stop staring!

00:23:11.100 --> 00:23:12.780
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Kuroageha Arrives</b>

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:14.000
Kuroageha Arrives.
